---
config:
  theme: default
title: Real-time Alert System Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant SocketIO
    participant Backend
    participant AlertService
    participant NLPMatcher
    participant MongoDB
    participant EmailService
    
    %% WebSocket Connection
    Note over User,EmailService: Establish WebSocket Connection
    User->>Browser: Open application
    Browser->>SocketIO: Connect to socket.io
    SocketIO->>Backend: Connection request
    Backend->>Backend: Verify JWT token from handshake
    Backend-->>SocketIO: Authentication successful
    SocketIO-->>Browser: Connected event
    Browser->>Browser: Subscribe to user channel
    
    %% New Job Alert Flow
    Note over User,EmailService: New Job Matching Alert
    AlertService->>AlertService: Cron triggers alert check
    AlertService->>MongoDB: Get new jobs (last 5 min)
    MongoDB-->>AlertService: New jobs array
    AlertService->>MongoDB: Get all active users
    MongoDB-->>AlertService: Users list
    
    loop For each user
        AlertService->>NLPMatcher: Match jobs with user profile
        NLPMatcher->>NLPMatcher: Calculate match scores
        NLPMatcher-->>AlertService: Matched jobs with scores
        
        alt Match score >= 80%
            AlertService->>MongoDB: Check subscription limits
            MongoDB-->>AlertService: User tier & alert count
            
            alt User has alerts remaining
                %% Create Alert
                AlertService->>MongoDB: Create alert document
                MongoDB-->>AlertService: Alert created
                
                %% Send Real-time Notification
                AlertService->>SocketIO: Emit to user channel
                SocketIO->>Browser: jobAlert event + job data
                Browser->>Browser: Show toast notification
                Browser->>User: Display alert popup
                
                %% Send Email
                par Send Email in Background
                    AlertService->>EmailService: Queue email job
                    EmailService->>EmailService: Format email template
                    EmailService->>EmailService: Send via SMTP
                    EmailService-->>AlertService: Email sent
                end
                
                %% Update Usage Counter
                AlertService->>MongoDB: Increment alertsUsed
                MongoDB-->>AlertService: Updated
                
            else Limit reached (Free tier)
                AlertService->>SocketIO: Emit upgrade prompt
                SocketIO->>Browser: upgradeRequired event
                Browser->>User: Show upgrade modal
            end
        end
    end
    
    %% User Interaction with Alert
    Note over User,EmailService: User Interacts with Alert
    User->>Browser: Click notification
    Browser->>API: GET /api/jobs/:jobId
    Backend->>MongoDB: Fetch job details
    MongoDB-->>Backend: Job data
    Backend-->>Browser: 200 OK + job
    Browser->>User: Display job modal
    
    %% Mark Alert as Read
    User->>Browser: Close notification
    Browser->>SocketIO: Emit alertRead event
    SocketIO->>Backend: Mark as read request
    Backend->>MongoDB: updateOne(alertId)<br/>$set isRead: true
    MongoDB-->>Backend: Updated
    Backend-->>Browser: Confirmation
    
    %% Disconnect
    Note over User,EmailService: User Closes Application
    User->>Browser: Close tab/window
    Browser->>SocketIO: Disconnect
    SocketIO->>Backend: Handle disconnect
    Backend->>Backend: Clean up user session
